1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:01,800
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,480
♪Makes me a little shy♪

3
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:05,120
♪When you say you love me♪

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,680
♪It's more than I ever imagined♪

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,640
♪Slowly♪

6
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,400
♪Stay by my side♪

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,760
♪Love is the warmth of everyday life♪

8
00:00:13,760 --> 00:00:15,480
♪The way you move in slow motion♪

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,200
♪Makes me a little shy♪

10
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,840
♪You lean your forehead against mine♪

11
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,560
♪Then you keep grinning like a fool♪

12
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Little by little♪

13
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:23,520
♪You come closer to me♪

14
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:27,320
♪A warm love song plays in my ear♪

15
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,760
=The One=

16
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,320
=Episode 19=

17
00:00:32,479 --> 00:00:33,240
These past few years,

18
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,359
Cheng Lin's been through a lot.

19
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:37,039
I'll make sure
he gets every opportunity.

20
00:00:37,039 --> 00:00:37,719
(Ji Group Charity Gala)

21
00:00:37,719 --> 00:00:38,560
And I hope all of you

22
00:00:39,159 --> 00:00:40,079
will look out for him.

23
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:45,840
Congratulations!

24
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:47,600
That's wonderful news.

25
00:00:47,759 --> 00:00:49,000
Congratulations!

26
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,520
Cheng Lin, this is Mr. Wen.

27
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,600
Cheers.

28
00:00:53,679 --> 00:00:54,560
A bright future ahead.

29
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:55,960
(An enviable new status.)

30
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:57,880
(A future full of possibilities.)

31
00:00:58,920 --> 00:00:59,719
(Congratulations.)

32
00:01:00,079 --> 00:01:00,960
(Cheng Lin.)

33
00:01:02,799 --> 00:01:03,719
Cheng Lin...

34
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:05,560
Oh, no.

35
00:01:06,719 --> 00:01:07,879
Guess we should call him Mr. Ji now.

36
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,760
What a surprise.

37
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,799
Playing the broke boy to win your heart.

38
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:14,959
That's quite the long game.

39
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,120
Don't tell me you just found out too.

40
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,480
Didn't he just say?

41
00:01:20,159 --> 00:01:21,159
They only just met.

42
00:01:22,359 --> 00:01:23,840
And they just helped me out.

43
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:28,360
♪You don't have to explain anymore♪

44
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:31,599
Congratulations.

45
00:01:32,360 --> 00:01:35,040
♪I just thought we'd come so far♪

46
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:38,680
♪Only to lose to unhappiness♪

47
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,320
♪Maybe all of this♪

48
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,960
♪Was fate all along♪

49
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:49,280
♪But I can't watch you walk away♪

50
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:54,240
♪Do you still miss me?♪

51
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:57,160
♪Do you still miss me?♪

52
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,640
Don't bother chasing after her.

53
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,879
She's not a woman you can control.

54
00:02:01,599 --> 00:02:02,280
Remember.

55
00:02:02,719 --> 00:02:05,159
A man needs money

56
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,200
and power

57
00:02:06,599 --> 00:02:08,240
to keep the woman he loves.

58
00:02:08,439 --> 00:02:10,840
She doesn't need a man's money
or status.

59
00:02:11,159 --> 00:02:12,159
And I don't want to go with you.

60
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,719
My mom won't agree either.

61
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,319
Madam Cheng agreed

62
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,520
to let me take you both back.

63
00:02:18,719 --> 00:02:19,879
Madam Cheng's worried about you.

64
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,000
We don't think

65
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,639
you and Ms. Su will last either.

66
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:26,000
Compared with how all-in you are,

67
00:02:27,879 --> 00:02:28,639
Ms. Su

68
00:02:29,360 --> 00:02:30,840
seems much more guarded.

69
00:02:32,719 --> 00:02:33,460
To her, you're just

70
00:02:33,461 --> 00:02:35,240
a rebound after her last relationship.

71
00:02:36,719 --> 00:02:37,719
Our relationship

72
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:39,800
isn't anyone else's to judge.

73
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:41,759
Pretty direct.

74
00:02:42,879 --> 00:02:43,520
Then, Cheng Lin...

75
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,280
(Ji Group Charity Gala)
Does she love you?

76
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,680
Come with me.

77
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,800
Ms. Su.

78
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,400
Forgive me for asking.

79
00:03:07,280 --> 00:03:08,080
Do you love Cheng Lin?

80
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:12,759
Mr. Ji.

81
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:15,159
You're planning to take Cheng Lin away.

82
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:17,800
You're sharp, Ms. Su.

83
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:20,000
But you haven't answered my question.

84
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:22,840
Do you love my brother?

85
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:25,560
Or rather,

86
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,159
how much do you love him?

87
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:31,680
Mr. Ji.

88
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,479
I'm past the age

89
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,039
of losing my head over love.

90
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,680
Then do you know how much he loves you?

91
00:03:42,639 --> 00:03:43,879
At nineteen,

92
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,840
you give love everything you've got.

93
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:48,639
And Cheng Lin...

94
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,800
gives me 100%.

95
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,520
So,

96
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:54,759
you've never thought about

97
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:56,240
a future with him?

98
00:03:57,720 --> 00:04:02,960
♪You gently leave your key by the door♪

99
00:04:03,039 --> 00:04:04,000
Never.

100
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:08,280
♪Neither of us says a word♪

101
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:13,840
♪About the past we shared♪

102
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:20,240
♪The picture on the wall still hangs♪

103
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,600
He'd be hurt if he heard that.

104
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:27,879
♪Packing sounds echo through the room♪

105
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:29,839
If there's anything I can do

106
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:30,759
to make it up to you, just say so.

107
00:04:34,360 --> 00:04:35,959
What you did for me at the gala

108
00:04:36,519 --> 00:04:37,519
was more than enough.

109
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,199
Including

110
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,160
the five-year contract.

111
00:04:41,519 --> 00:04:42,199
More than enough.

112
00:04:44,759 --> 00:04:45,759
I awarded that five-year contract

113
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,399
because I admire your charisma

114
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:50,480
and your professional ability.

115
00:04:50,839 --> 00:04:51,600
Nothing else.

116
00:04:53,160 --> 00:04:54,160
Honestly,

117
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,319
for a young man like him

118
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,720
to fall for a mature woman like you

119
00:04:59,800 --> 00:05:01,079
is certainly

120
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,360
a special

121
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,079
and unforgettable experience.

122
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:06,960
♪Some love is still there♪

123
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,279
♪But I can't put it into words♪

124
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:09,360
I won't stand in his way.

125
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:12,240
My plans for the future

126
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:14,360
don't include men or romance.

127
00:05:15,160 --> 00:05:16,199
Whether he wants to leave

128
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:17,920
or stay,

129
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,600
that's his choice.

130
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:21,680
♪I was never the one♪

131
00:05:21,680 --> 00:05:22,680
♪Just another one♪

132
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:24,360
♪Never your exception♪

133
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,480
♪The more I hurt♪

134
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,440
♪The more I hope♪

135
00:05:26,440 --> 00:05:28,160
♪For the love you give me♪

136
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,280
♪Our story♪

137
00:05:29,280 --> 00:05:30,280
♪Changed♪

138
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:32,040
♪With memories overflowing♪

139
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,840
♪How am I supposed to move on?♪

140
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,400
(Su Yan.)

141
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:39,400
(Tell me.)

142
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:41,560
(What would make you feel better?)

143
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:44,560
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

144
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:48,080
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

145
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:51,600
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

146
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:55,360
♪But you said time would make it fade♪

147
00:06:10,360 --> 00:06:13,840
♪Memories pile up, moment by moment♪

148
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:17,480
♪One careless word brings my walls down♪

149
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:20,680
♪I escape the past, then fall back in♪

150
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:24,360
♪Longing twists into a hopeless knot♪

151
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:27,760
♪Pulled by the past
till my world fades out♪

152
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:31,440
♪I hum this song alone♪

153
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:35,280
♪Counting every fleeting moment♪

154
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:39,360
♪Every corner still reminds me of you♪

155
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:42,640
♪Can you hear how much I miss you?♪

156
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:46,240
♪It hits like a wave I can't contain♪

157
00:06:46,240 --> 00:06:49,720
♪I can't let go of the path we shared♪

158
00:06:49,720 --> 00:06:54,600
♪But you said time would make it fade♪
